ember came in under 90% of normal in 38 years, more than any other pair, and in 2025 it came in at 39% of normal. So far in 2026 on the middle of the grids, January to February sits at 23% and June to July at 172%. Both grids had their driest year in 1963, at 63% on grid 20264 and 62% on grid 20265.</p>"}
